1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,000
One day at a local shop. Nine ways to tell it.

2
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:12,200
Five thirty. Before the street wakes, the shutter goes up.

3
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:24,700
Eleven. A new arrival, straight into the glass case.

4
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:30,700
One o'clock. The lunch rush.

5
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:37,200
Three. A neighbour orders from her phone.

6
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:43,200
The order crosses two streets, and arrives in minutes.

7
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:50,200
Six. The after-school quest for sweets.

8
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:56,200
Nine. The street goes quiet. One lamp stays lit.

9
00:00:56,800 --> 00:01:03,400
One shop. One day. Now online, with PawanSetu.
